Package: dMI
Title: dMI: Distance-based Mutual Information Test of Multivariate
    Association
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Rebecca A.", "Deek", , "rdeek@pitt.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: dMI is an R package for estimation of distance-based mutual
    information and multivariate association testing using a corresponding
    permutation test. The package implements a nonparametric density
    estimation procedure of distance-based mutual information using
    k-nearest neighbor (kNN) distances and a permutation test for
    independence.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
Imports: 
    future,
    future.apply,
    IndepTest,
    stats
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    vegan
